    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "Round-trips a {@link RunCodec} through {@link CodecEncoding}: encodes it to a specifier array, then decodes that array back into a codec. <p> The first entry of the specifier array is the encoding byte; for a RunCodec the spec reserves the range 117..140, which this method asserts. The remaining entries are the band-header bytes that {@link CodecEncoding#getCodec} reads from its input stream. @param original the codec to encode. @param defaultForBand the band default passed to both encode and decode. @return the codec decoded back from {@code original}'s specifier."
   },
